<BaseLayout title="Interior">
  <h1>Interior</h1>
  <p>This section covers the S60 cabin, seating, driver controls, storage, climate system, materials, and occupant safety. The dashboard architecture is characteristic of the third-generation S60, but upholstery, trim, seat functions, audio, displays, and convenience equipment vary by trim and option package.</p>
  <ReferencePhoto src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/2020_Volvo_S60_T8_Twin_Engine_AWD_R-Design_%28Cockpit%29.jpg/1280px-2020_Volvo_S60_T8_Twin_Engine_AWD_R-Design_%28Cockpit%29.jpg" variant="reference-photo" alt="Photograph of the right-hand-drive cockpit in a 2020 Volvo S60 T8 Twin Engine AWD R-Design" caption="Real third-generation S60 cockpit photograph: 2020 T8 R-Design, Thailand-market right-hand drive. Useful for cabin architecture and material reference only; steering position, equipment and trim differ from North American 2021 cars." credit="Chanokchon" source="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2020_Volvo_S60_T8_Twin_Engine_AWD_R-Design_(Cockpit).jpg" license="CC BY-SA 4.0" />
  <ReferencePhoto src="https://www.volvocars.com/media/support-content/img028459637a80b16dc0a801526df36585_1_--_--_VOICEpnghigh.png" variant="reference-diagram" alt="Volvo 2021 S60 dashboard and display illustration with steering wheel, instrument panel, center display and example warning-symbol insets" caption="Volvo 2021 S60 dashboard reference. The insets show example driver-display symbols; they are not a complete equipment list or center-screen menu." credit="Volvo Cars" source="https://www.volvocars.com/en-ca/support/car/s60/21w46/article/5b78d70bc7e244b1c0a81f6f7b69c865/5e799f698c111823c0a8cc723353898c/f6848b197ef39a36c0a80151207886f7/" license="Volvo Cars support illustration" />
